    "body": "## Fixes\n\n- **Actor portrait now matches the Black ICE.** Previously the actor sheet showed mystery-man while the token had the right image; `actorData.img` is now set alongside the prototype token texture.\n- **Netrunner is added to the combat tracker** alongside the Black ICE so you have both sides on the tracker, not a one-sided combat.\n- **Drag-token crash fixed.** Tokens were created from `prototypeToken.toObject()` directly, which left `tokenDocument.actor` null and crashed CPR's `warn-on-moving-locked-container` hook on every drag (`Cannot read properties of null (reading 'type')`). Switched to `Actor#getTokenDocument()`, which is the proper Foundry pattern and wires up actorId, delta, and other required fields.\n\nUpdate via the manifest URL (Foundry will offer it automatically)."
  },
