    "body": "## Initial release\n\nFirst release of **Automate Net Combat**. Ships 12 CRB Black ICE as a compendium, adds a one-click summon workflow, and automates attack resolution + damage application for CPR netrunning combat.\n\n### What's in the box\n\n- **Compendium packs**: 12 CRB Black ICE (Asp, Giant, Hellhound, Kraken, Liche, Raven, Scorpion, Skunk, Wisp, Dragon, Killer, Sabertooth) — each shipped as both a \\`blackIce\\` actor and a \\`program\\` item with class \\`blackice\\`\n- **Summon flow**: scene-controls toolbar button + Tile HUD button; click-on-canvas netrunner picker; spawns actor + owned program + unlinked token + CPR \\`programUUID\\` flag + combat entry on SPD + 1d10\n- **Attack pipeline**: 1d10 + ATK with CPR crit rules, damage rolled per anti-personnel/anti-program mode, applied to netrunner HP or a random rezzed program's REZ; full chat card with roll breakdown and effect text\n- **Architect interop**: detects Black ICE tiles from cpr-netrunning-architect via flags or texture name\n- **Experimental auto-spawn** on netrunner tile crossing (off by default)\n\n### Installation\n\nPaste this manifest URL into Foundry's Install Module dialog:\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nhttps://github.com/VebjornNyvoll/automate-net-combat/releases/latest/download/module.json\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Known limitations\n\n- Stats for all 12 Black ICE are authored from CRB p.201–203 but should be verified and tweaked by the GM against their own reading of the rules\n- \"Effect\" text (e.g. Hellhound burn, Raven trace, Liche NET-action loss) is printed to the chat card for GM adjudication but not mechanically applied\n- Only English localization\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/VebjornNyvoll/automate-net-combat#readme) for full usage docs."
